WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:07.560
When was the last time you were the first person to do something?

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:12.360
"The LPL has never won before, but that will change today!"

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:18.020
"Evo world champion, Arslan Ash!"

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:22.560
"Cloud9 are your ELEAGUE Major champions!"

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:27.040
For most people pioneering anything is a pipe dream at best, but meet Ewok

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:32.180
the fourteen-year-old deaf female streamer who joined FaZe Clan back in July as a content creator.

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:36.200
(applause)

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:42.840
If her rapid rise to success is a sign of things to come she's going to kicking some serious ass in the near future

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:47.540
"Ewok! Ewok! Ewok!"

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:51.720
She broke the glass ceiling on a notoriously bro-esque gaming org

00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:54.660
and is also probably the first deaf Twitch partner.

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:56.560
Here is what she had to say.

00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:07.020
Now Ewok was born deaf,

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:13.200
so she can't rely on in-game sounds to know where the enemy is or anything else going on in the game, for that matter.

00:01:17.480 --> 00:01:19.620
"Do you hear that?"

00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:20.620
"Yeah."

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:21.640
"What is that?"

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:24.210
"Maybe the missile?"

00:01:24.210 --> 00:01:27.160
Instead, Ewok uses sound visualization,

00:01:27.160 --> 00:01:30.180
which turns the game's audio into visual cues.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:36.140
And if you think that sounds easy in a game like Fortnite where there's a ton of 3D space? Think again.

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:44.700
"Bro, this is so hard. It sounds like everything's under you or in front of you."

00:01:44.780 --> 00:01:46.800
"There's no left or right audio, wow."

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:53.100
Ewok's popularity steadily rose after she joined Twitch in January of this year, and it's pretty easy to see why

00:02:06.620 --> 00:02:12.100
But Ewok's biggest viewer bump came after popular streamer TimTheTatman hosted her channel.

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:15.360
TimTheTatman: "This girl I am about to host chat, she's deaf, okay?"

00:02:15.580 --> 00:02:17.520
"So everyone go give her a lot of love."

00:02:17.520 --> 00:02:22.640
Ewok's subscribers and live viewership went from hundreds to thousands pretty quickly.

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:25.380
And the gaming world was all ears.

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:28.920
FaZe Apex: "She's deaf, she's thirteen, and she's disgustingly good."

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:35.680
TimTheTatman: "She's deaf. Like she can't hear. And she's insane, she's so good. Better than me!"

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:37.840
NICKMERCS: "She actually does all this with no sound."

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:44.920
NICKMERCS: "If I am playing with no sound, I don't have any idea. Oh my god."

00:02:44.980 --> 00:02:50.460
Ewok started playing with some of Twitch's biggest names like Ninja, Dr. Lupo and Liquid Chap.

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:52.680
Ninja: "Ewok!"

00:02:57.560 --> 00:02:59.640
"Absolutely well played!"

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:04.800
And FaZe Clan really embraced Ewok even adding an I-love-you sign language emoji to their Twitter handle.

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:12.240
FaZe Kay: "We put this together for you....FaZe merch, there is definitely some exclusive stuff in there."

00:03:12.260 --> 00:03:15.800
She might be young, but she's definitely not shy.

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:21.060
Ewok joined other unhappy players calling out the Fortnite devs on Twitter after they added the BRUTE mech to the game.

00:03:25.020 --> 00:03:28.000
Tfue: "I'm f#@$ing dead. This game is ass."

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:31.940
And on top of it Ewok showing no signs of slowing down,

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:36.360
she often talks about the next generation chasing their dreams and just going after it.

00:03:50.220 --> 00:03:56.980
Now, it's no secret that the internet is a shitty and toxic place sometimes. But Ewok's story stands out as a beacon of positivity

00:04:10.880 --> 00:04:15.500
She's turned what many would see is a disadvantage into an inspiring story for others.

00:04:16.140 --> 00:04:18.140
And that's how you do it first.

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:19.800
Ewok: "FaZe up!"

